IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPLITFUSE-SCHEDULE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PROMPT-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CHUNK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONCURRENT-DECODES  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SATURATION-PCT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 GAIN-RATIO-X100     PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPLITFUSE.
    IF CHUNK-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF CONCURRENT-DECODES > 8
        MOVE 8 TO CONCURRENT-DECODES.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE SATURATION-PCT = (50 * PROMPT-LEN / CHUNK-SIZE) + (50 * CONCURRENT-DECODES / 8).
    IF SATURATION-PCT > 100
        MOVE 100 TO SATURATION-PCT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE GAIN-RATIO-X100 = 100 + (SATURATION-PCT * 125 / 100).

    SET depth 4.
    WEIGHT 32 GAIN-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 SATURATION-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
